CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'f->type == V4L2_BUF_TYPE_VIDEO_OUTPUT_MPLANE'
#123: FILE: drivers/media/platform/mtk-vcodec/mtk_vcodec_dec.c:422:
+	if (!dec_pdata->uses_stateless_api &&
+	    (f->type == V4L2_BUF_TYPE_VIDEO_OUTPUT_MPLANE) &&
 	    vb2_is_busy(&ctx->m2m_ctx->out_q_ctx.q)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

